E('nodular','英 /ˈnɒdʒələ/；美 /ˈnɑːdʒələr/','结节状的；有小团块的','看上去或构造上是一颗颗小团块，而不是平整的一片。','英语 nodule + -ar；去掉 nodule 末尾 e，形成描述形态或性质的形容词。',NL+[['英语 nodule + -ar → nodular','像小结节的；由小结节构成的']],'nodular rock 可以说岩石有结核状团块，医学描述中的 nodular 则强调结节形态。它是“长成什么样”的描述，不能单靠这个形容词推出具体原因或诊断。','a nodular surface；nodular rock；a nodular structure；nodular growth。','nodal 是与 node“节点、结”有关；nodular 是与 nodule“小团块”有关。网络节点的连接不称 nodular connections。',('The rock has a nodular structure rather than a smooth, uniform texture.','这块岩石呈结核状结构，并非平滑均匀的质地。'),('The report describes the swelling as nodular.','报告把这处肿起描述为结节状。'),sources=['https://www.etymonline.com/word/nodular','https://www.collinsdictionary.com/dictionary/english/nodular','https://dictionary.cambridge.org/pronunciation/english/nodular','https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/nodular','https://www.cancer.gov/publications/dictionaries/cancer-terms/def/nodule']),
